      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) boolean, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if <b>id</b> is over land owned by the script owner, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> otherwise.</p>
</p>
